  "body_html": "<h1>Weakly Dominant Strategy</h1>\n<p>A strategy $s_i$ is weakly dominant for player $i$ if it weakly dominates every\nother strategy available to $i$:</p>\n<p>$$\\forall s'_i \\in S_i, \\quad s_i \\text{ weakly dominates } s'_i.$$</p>",
